          "date": "2026-11-20 18:18:29.000000000",
          "tz": 0
        },
        "subject": "LU-21275 tests: re-read initial_grant in sanity 64f",
        "message": "LU-21275 tests: re-read initial_grant in sanity 64f\n\ntest_64f remounts the client a second time to reset the OST grant,\nbut keeps using the init_grants value read after the first mount.\nThe initial grant an OST gives out on a new connection is not\nalways the same, so the remaining check_grants calls compare\nagainst a stale expected value and the test intermittently fails\nwith \"grants mismatch\".\n\nRe-read initial_grant from the OSC import after the second\nremount_client.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity env=ONLY=64f,ONLY_REPEAT=20\nSigned-off-by: John Grasso <johgras@amazon.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5\nChange-Id: I2f7ed2ed90cb1f744468a9283e94f48751ece1dc\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
